    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4819" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλωπέκ-ειος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλωπέκ-εος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">η</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of a fox,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στέαρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					14.331
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίπος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philum.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				45.29.36
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλωπεκέη,</span>
			
				Att.
			
			
				contr.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῆ</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δορά</span>), <i>fox-skin,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				7.75
			</span></i>: prov., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅπου ἡ λεοντῆ μὴ ἐφικνεῖται,
					προσραπτέον ἐκεῖ τὴν ἀλωπεκῆν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Lys.</u>
					7
				</span></i>
			.</div>
